# Template + Preview Audit Rule

## Scope

- Apply to all current templates and every newly created template.
- Audit all HTML demo pages and wrapped preview pages (`home`, `about`, `services`, `contact`, and any added pages).

## Build + Brand Requirements

- Every template must be a unique build designed for Mateo Consulting Tech business goals.
- Reuse `@crafto-html-templates/` components and functionality as building blocks only; do not ship Crafto branding/content.
- Replace any visible "Crafto", "ThemeZaa", or Crafto vendor references with "Mateo Consulting Tech" (unless hidden/internal technical pathing requires otherwise).
- Template links must not default to Crafto destinations.
- Use Mateo business logo assets for favicon and primary brand logo in all live preview templates:
  - Favicon: `/static/images/logos/mateo-favicon.ico`
  - Header/footer primary logo: `/static/images/logos/mateo-logo_horizontal_transparent.png`
- Wire these through `app/services/crafto_preview_wrap.py` (`rewrite_crafto_brand_assets`); do not use Crafto demo logos or legacy `mateo-logo.svg` / `mateo-favicon.svg` in wrapped live previews.
- Do not use Crafto demo logos in preview header/footer brand lockups.
- Render `mateo-logo_horizontal_transparent.png` with balanced non-overlapping header sizing (`56px` max height + `220px` max width desktop preview, `34px` max height + `170px` max width mobile preview) via `mkt-mateo-brand-logo` and preview CSS — do not upscale the PNG file.

## Mandatory Audit Checklist (run on each template update)

- Validate all anchor links in header, footer, nav, CTA blocks, and key section components.
- Validate there are no `/crafto/#` or bare `#` hrefs in wrapped live preview output.
- Convert any would-be `/crafto/#` links to `/preview/{slug}/home`.
- Validate all JS and CSS references used by each HTML demo page (no missing or broken asset paths).
- Validate component/partial references used to assemble demo pages.
- Validate favicon and primary logo sources in preview pages resolve to Mateo assets.
- Validate visible header/footer text has no "Crafto" or "ThemeZaa" after preview rewrites.
- Replace header/footer branding mentions with "Mateo Consulting Tech".
- Validate live preview `<title>` is exactly `Mateo Consulting Team - The Multipurpose HTML5 Template` for all preview pages.
- Ensure preview chrome links (`Back`, page tabs, `Purchase`) resolve correctly for each slug.
- Ensure preview chrome toolbar shows Mateo logo before the `Home` link/tab for every slug/page.
- Ensure no broken links remain in preview output.

## Preview Fallback + Routing Rules

- If a requested preview-site page does not exist, default to that template's home preview route.
- Broken or unmapped preview-site links must gracefully route to `/preview/{slug}/home` instead of failing.
- Allowed preview page links should resolve to `/preview/{slug}/{page}`.

## Verification Commands

- Run `py scripts/audit_preview_header_footer_links.py` after template/preview link changes.
- Run `py scripts/audit_crafto_hash_links.py` and ensure matches are zero.
- Run `py scripts/audit_preview_titles.py` and ensure mismatches are zero.
- Run `py scripts/audit_assets_components.py` after branding/logo or asset changes.
- Run `py scripts/audit_preview_logo_placement.py` and ensure fails are zero (logo before `Home`, no overlap).
- Save or update report output in `scripts/audit_report.txt` and review flagged issues before completion.
